<title>PHILIPPINES: Empire East falls 12 pct in late trade.</title>
<headline>Empire East falls 12 pct in late trade.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Empire East Land Holdings Inc fell 55 centavos, or 12.2 percent, to 3.95 pesos by late trade as investors maintained their selling stance, brokers said.</p>
<p>Empire was one of the heavily traded counters on Thursday.</p>
<p>Empire has been battered in recent weeks on fears of a collapse in the local property sector.</p>
<p>Company officials have denied that Empire and its parent Megaworld Properties &amp; Holdings Inc are facing financial difficulties.</p>
</text>
